<details class="g3-import" id="g3-import-details"><summary>Import a measured color chart / manage measured sets</summary>
<p>Import finished, pressed fabric measurements to explore a wider tested range. CSV headers: <strong>ID,L,a,b,C,M,Y,K</strong>; the four CMYK columns are optional. L*, a*, b* and LAB_L / LAB_A / LAB_B are also accepted. Standard results CSV files use their <strong>Measured L / Measured a / Measured b</strong> columns; unmeasured rows are skipped. Estimates and target values are never substituted for measurements.</p>
<p>Up to 2,500 points per set and 4 sets. One set must use one measurement condition and one production setup. The checker does not parse ICC profiles or convert D50/D65, observer, backing or instrument modes.</p>
<div class="actions"><button class="btn" id="g3-template" type="button">Download empty CSV template</button><button class="btn" id="g3-use-setup" type="button">Copy saved test setup to this form</button><button class="btn" disabled="" id="g3-confirm-set" type="button">Confirm comparison with this master</button><button class="btn btn-danger" disabled="" id="g3-delete-set" type="button">Delete selected imported set</button></div>
